OL,3,GNEWSARoads blocked by trees and
OL,4,Aflooding as storm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlooding and trees toppled by Storm
OL,7,FBoelo are making the roads more
OL,8,Fdangerous, police have warned, while
OL,9,Fmany households are without power.
OL,11,FCumbria Police has asked people to plan
OL,12,Ftheir journeys safely as trees, debris
OL,13,Fand surface water are impacting
OL,14,Fconditions across the county, while
OL,15,FElectricity North West said it was
OL,16,Fworking to restore the power to
OL,17,Fthousands of homes.
