OL,3,GNEWSARoads blocked by trees and
OL,4,Aflooding as storm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amber weather warning from the Met
OL,7,FOffice for strong winds was in place
OL,8,Funtil 21:00 GMT, with speeds
OL,9,Fapproaching 78mph at St Bees Head
OL,10,Fearlier.
OL,12,FAn amber road alert issued by National
OL,13,FHighways for strong winds was in place
OL,14,Funtil 16:00 today and affected
OL,15,Fnorth-east England and Cumbria.
